cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Geography Literature Review Research Skill
type: software
version: 2.0.0
date-released: "2026-08-26"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/wzgytuA888/geography-literature-review-skill"
abstract: >-
  A research skill that distills review methodology from a benchmark corpus of
  high-quality geography reviews (Book-to-Skill approach) and executes an
  evidence-first multi-agent pipeline — Semantic Scholar/OpenAlex discovery,
  human-gated full-text acquisition, provenance-tracked synthesis, Zotero-verified
  citations, draft figures, and independent audit — for arbitrary user topics.
keywords:
  - literature-review
  - geography
  - agent-skills
  - multi-agent
  - zotero
  - semantic-scholar
  - openalex
  - crossref
  - evidence-synthesis
